    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Knight in silver plate with gold filigree, blue tabard bearing a sunburst device, a blue plumed helm worn back on the head and a round gold shield strapped across the back. Gauntlet fingers, knee cops and sabatons are individually modelled; the rear views confirm the shield boss and strap hardware. The heraldry is an invented sunburst, not an identifiable real coat of arms. 292k tris. Rigged: 24-bone humanoid armature with walk and run clips, zero unweighted skinned vertices.",
    "limitations": [
      "AI-assisted origin (Meshy) is disclosed upstream.",
      "The shield is fused to the body mesh and cannot be unequipped without editing.",
      "24-bone rig; gauntlet fingers are static.",
      "The static inspection views were rechecked on 2026-11-06: the proportions and/or costume presentation are stylized rather than photorealistic."
    ],
